---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DraftingGrid from '../components/grids/DraftingGrid';
---

<Layout 
	title="Cocinas Integrales | Vyroba Wood"
	description="Diseño y fabricación de cocinas integrales a escala industrial. Ergonomía y materiales de alta durabilidad para proyectos constructivos de gran volumen."
	keywords="cocinas integrales, fabricación de cocinas, módulos de cocina b2b, tableros de alta densidad, vyroba wood cocinas"
>
  <main class="relative">
    <DraftingGrid client:load theme="cocinas" />

    <!-- HERO SECTION: COCINAS -->
    <section class="relative z-10 min-h-[70vh] pt-[120px] pb-12 px-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col justify-end border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-[#8a501c]/5">
      <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto w-full relative z-10">
        <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black text-outline/30 block mb-4">01</span>
            <h2 class="font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-xs uppercase text-[#8a501c] mb-4 block">Líneas B2B</h2>   
            <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-[8vw] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] text-primary font-cabinet">
                Cocinas<br/>Integrales
            </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-12 items-end">
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-on-surface-variant font-medium leading-[1.3] max-w-2xl">
                Producción modular en serie preparada para altos volúmenes residenciales y comerciales. Arquitectura de ensamblaje diseñada para minimizar tiempos de instalación en obra.
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-start md:justify-end gap-4">
                <a href="#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#8a501c] text-white font-bold border border-[#0f1c28] uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-none transition-all duration-150 shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_#0f1c28] hover:bg-[#162839] hover:translate-x-[4px] hover:translate-y-[4px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_#0f1c28] active:translate-x-[8px] active:translate-y-[8px] active:shadow-none whitespace-nowrap">
                    Cotizar Proyecto
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SPECIFICATIONS / TECHNICAL DETAILS -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 md:px-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 relative z-10 w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface">
      <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
          
          <!-- Details Left -->
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase text-primary mb-8 font-cabinet">Ingeniería del Módulo</h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-on-surface-variant font-medium leading-relaxed mb-8">
              Cada módulo base y de alacena está diseñado como una unidad estructural independiente. Utilizamos herrajes heavy-duty con capacidad de carga superior calculada para entornos de alto tráfico. Las perforaciones de la tornillería se realizan con ruteo de precisión asegurando tolerancias de 0.05mm para un cuadre perfecto de las puertas.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Features List -->
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="border-l-2 border-[#8a501c] pl-6">
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary uppercase">Alta Densidad</h4>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-sm">Resistencia estructural frente a la flexión en encimeras flotantes.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-[#8a501c] pl-6">
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary uppercase">Acabado Industrial</h4>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-sm">Sellado termoplástico perimetral antivapor y líquidos en toda la estructura.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-[#8a501c] pl-6">
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary uppercase">Componentes Preensamblados</h4>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-sm">Guías, bisagras y jaladeras pre-perforadas desde planta matriz.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Graphic / Tech Spec Visual -->
          <div class="bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/30 p-12 flex flex-col justify-center items-center relative group">
             <!-- Technical grid background -->
             <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:20px_20px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
             
             <!-- Center Technical SVG -->
             <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-150 -15 360 135" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" class="w-full max-w-[700px] h-auto overflow-visible text-primary/50 relative z-10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-[#8a501c]">
                
                <!-- FRONT ELEVATION - PURE FRONTAL (FLAT) -->
                <!-- Floor line -->
                <line x1="-120" y1="90" x2="160" y2="90" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></line>

                <!-- BASE CABINETS (-60 to 100) -->
                <!-- Bank 1: Drawers -->
                <rect x="-60" y="55" width="40" height="30"></rect>
                <line x1="-60" y1="65" x2="-20" y2="65"></line>
                <line x1="-60" y1="75" x2="-20" y2="75"></line>
                <line x1="-45" y1="60" x2="-35" y2="60"></line> <!-- Handle -->
                <line x1="-45" y1="70" x2="-35" y2="70"></line>
                <line x1="-45" y1="80" x2="-35" y2="80"></line>

                <!-- Bank 2: Range / Oven -->
                <rect x="-20" y="55" width="40" height="30"></rect>
                <rect x="-14" y="58" width="28" height="18" rx="1"></rect> <!-- oven window -->
                <line x1="-20" y1="80" x2="20" y2="80"></line> <!-- oven bottom drawer -->
                <circle cx="-5" cy="55" r="0.5" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                <circle cx="5" cy="55" r="0.5" fill="currentColor"></circle>

                <!-- Bank 3: Sink Base (Double Doors) -->
                <rect x="20" y="55" width="40" height="30"></rect>
                <line x1="40" y1="55" x2="40" y2="85"></line> <!-- split -->
                <line x1="35" y1="58" x2="38" y2="58"></line> <!-- handle -->
                <line x1="45" y1="58" x2="42" y2="58"></line> <!-- handle -->
                
                <!-- Bank 4: Standard Base (Double Doors) -->
                <rect x="60" y="55" width="40" height="30"></rect>
                <line x1="80" y1="55" x2="80" y2="85"></line> <!-- split -->
                <line x1="75" y1="58" x2="78" y2="58"></line> <!-- handle -->
                <line x1="85" y1="58" x2="82" y2="58"></line> <!-- handle -->

                <!-- Tall Pantry / Fridge (100 to 140) -->
                <rect x="100" y="15" width="40" height="70"></rect>
                <line x1="100" y1="55" x2="140" y2="55"></line> <!-- horizontal split -->
                <line x1="120" y1="15" x2="120" y2="85"></line> <!-- vertical split -->
                <line x1="115" y1="50" x2="115" y2="54"></line> <!-- handle -->
                <line x1="125" y1="50" x2="125" y2="54"></line> <!-- handle -->
                <line x1="115" y1="58" x2="115" y2="62"></line> <!-- handle -->
                <line x1="125" y1="58" x2="125" y2="62"></line> <!-- handle -->

                <!-- Countertop -->
                <rect x="-62" y="52" width="164" height="3" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.1"></rect>

                <!-- Sink Faucet -->
                <path d="M 40 52 L 40 45 C 40 40 33 40 33 45" fill="none" stroke-width="0.8"></path>

                <!-- Toe Kick -->
                <rect x="-58" y="85" width="194" height="5" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.1"></rect>

                <!-- UPPER CABINETS -->
                <!-- Bank 1: Upper -->
                <rect x="-60" y="15" width="40" height="25"></rect>
                <line x1="-40" y1="15" x2="-40" y2="40"></line>
                <line x1="-45" y1="35" x2="-42" y2="35"></line>
                <line x1="-35" y1="35" x2="-38" y2="35"></line>

                <!-- Bank 2: Range Hood (over oven) -->
                <rect x="-20" y="15" width="40" height="15"></rect>
                <path d="M -20 30 L -15 45 L 15 45 L 20 30 Z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.05"></path>

                <!-- Bank 3: Upper -->
                <rect x="20" y="15" width="40" height="25"></rect>
                <line x1="40" y1="15" x2="40" y2="40"></line>
                <line x1="35" y1="35" x2="38" y2="35"></line>
                <line x1="45" y1="35" x2="42" y2="35"></line>

                <!-- Bank 4: Upper -->
                <rect x="60" y="15" width="40" height="25"></rect>
                <line x1="80" y1="15" x2="80" y2="40"></line>
                <line x1="75" y1="35" x2="78" y2="35"></line>
                <line x1="85" y1="35" x2="82" y2="35"></line>

                <!-- DIMENSIONS / ANNOTATIONS -->
                <!-- Base Height Dim -->
                <line x1="-75" y1="52" x2="-75" y2="90" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <line x1="-77" y1="52" x2="-73" y2="52" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <line x1="-77" y1="90" x2="-73" y2="90" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <text x="-78" y="71" font-family="monospace" font-size="2.5" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 -78 71)" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">H=900 BASE MAX</text>

                <!-- Splash Clearance Dim -->
                <line x1="-75" y1="40" x2="-75" y2="52" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <line x1="-77" y1="40" x2="-73" y2="40" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <text x="-78" y="46" font-family="monospace" font-size="2.5" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 -78 46)" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">CLEAR=600 MIN</text>

                <!-- Width Dim -->
                <line x1="-60" y1="5" x2="140" y2="5" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <line x1="-60" y1="3" x2="-60" y2="7" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <line x1="140" y1="3" x2="140" y2="7" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <text x="40" y="3" font-family="monospace" font-size="2.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">W=2000 (MODULAR 5X400)</text>

                <!-- ELEVATION SYMBOL -->
                <path d="M 155 90 L 158 87 L 161 90 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path>
                <line x1="152" y1="90" x2="164" y2="90" stroke-width="0.5"></line>
                <text x="158" y="94" font-family="monospace" font-size="2.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">NPT ±0.00</text>

                <!-- CALLOUTS -->
                <!-- Callout 1 -->
                <circle cx="-40" cy="25" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
                <line x1="-40" y1="25" x2="-85" y2="-5" stroke-width="0.3" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></line>
                <text x="-90" y="-3" font-family="monospace" font-size="6" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="end" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">SUPERFICIES ESTÉTICAS</text>

                <!-- Callout 2 -->
                <circle cx="80" cy="40" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
                <line x1="80" y1="40" x2="120" y2="25" stroke-width="0.3" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></line>
                <line x1="120" y1="25" x2="160" y2="25" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <text x="165" y="27" font-family="monospace" font-size="6" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="start" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">HERRAJES DE EXCELENTE CALIDAD</text>

                <!-- Callout 3 -->
                <circle cx="40" cy="65" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
                <line x1="40" y1="65" x2="0" y2="105" stroke-width="0.3" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></line>
                <line x1="0" y1="105" x2="-100" y2="105" stroke-width="0.3"></line>
                <text x="-105" y="107" font-family="monospace" font-size="6" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="end" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">VOLUMETRÍA ESTRUCTURAL</text>
                            
              </svg>
              
              <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-outline uppercase tracking-widest">
                FIG. A-C / DIAGRAMA MODULAR
              </div>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- IMPLEMENTATION GALLERY -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 md:px-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 relative z-10 w-full bg-transparent">
      <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Section Header -->
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between mb-12">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#8B3A36] uppercase mb-4">Registro Operativo</h2>
            <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-primary font-cabinet">Galería de Implementación</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden md:block text-right">
            <p class="text-sm font-mono text-outline font-bold">REF // G-002</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Gallery Grid (Blueprint placeholders) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 border-l border-t border-outline-variant/20 auto-rows-fr">
          
          <!-- Image Placeholder 1 (BENTO LARGE - Diagram to Render) -->
          <div class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-white overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair min-h-[400px] md:min-h-0">
            <!-- Default State: The Blueprint/Diagram -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/diagramRender.png" alt="Cocina Plan" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0" />
            <!-- Hover State: The Real Render -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/kitchenRender.png" alt="Cocina Render" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100" />
            <!-- Technical label (disappears on hover) -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 font-mono text-xs text-primary/70 font-bold opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 bg-white/80 px-2 py-1">FIG 01 // ESQUEMA Y RENDER</div>
          </div>

          <!-- PROMPT 1 -->
          <div class="aspect-square relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] opacity-100 z-0"></div>
            <!-- BASE IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderkitchen1.png" alt="Nordic Kitchen Scene" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0 z-0" />
            <!-- HOVER IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderkitchen1B.png" alt="Nordic Kitchen Hover" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 z-0" />
          </div>

          <!-- PROMPT 2 -->
          <div class="aspect-square relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] opacity-100 z-0"></div>
            <!-- BASE IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen2.png" alt="Brutalism Kitchen Scene" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0 z-0" />
            <!-- HOVER IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderkitchen2B.png" alt="Brutalism Kitchen Hover" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 z-0" />
          </div>

          <!-- PROMPT 3 -->
          <div class="aspect-square relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] opacity-100 z-0"></div>
            <!-- BASE IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen3.png" alt="Monolith Kitchen Scene" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0 z-0" />
            <!-- HOVER IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen3B.png" alt="Monolith Kitchen Hover" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 z-0" />
          </div>

          <!-- PROMPT 4 -->
          <div class="aspect-square relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] opacity-100 z-0"></div>
            <!-- BASE IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen4.png" alt="Warm Nat Kitchen Scene" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0 z-0" />
            <!-- HOVER IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen4B.png" alt="Warm Nat Kitchen Hover" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 z-0" />
          </div>

          <!-- PROMPT 5 -->
          <div class="aspect-square relative group border-r border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,40,57,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:10px_10px] opacity-100 z-0"></div>
            <!-- BASE IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen5.png" alt="Gallery Kitchen Scene" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0 z-0" />
            <!-- HOVER IMAGE -->
            <img src="/images/kitchen/renderKitchen5B.png" alt="Gallery Kitchen Hover" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100 z-0" />
    </section>

    <script is:inline>
      document.querySelectorAll('.copy-btn').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          const text = btn.getAttribute('data-prompt');
          if(text) {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
              const originalHtml = btn.innerHTML;
              btn.innerHTML = '✅ COPIADO';
              setTimeout(() => { btn.innerHTML = originalHtml; }, 2000);
            }).catch(err => console.error('Error al copiar:', err));
          }
        });
      });
    </script>    
    <!-- CTA Final -->
    <section id="contacto" class="w-full bg-[#8a501c] text-surface py-32 border-t border-[#162839] relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-[#162839]/20 transform skew-x-[-15deg] origin-bottom-right z-0"></div>
        <div class="px-6 md:px-12 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-[6vw] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] text-surface font-cabinet mb-8 max-w-4xl">
                Inicia tu <span class="text-[#162839]">Producción</span>.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-surface/90 font-medium leading-[1.4] mb-12 max-w-xl">
                Envía los requerimientos BIM/CAD de tu desarrollo o residencial. Evaluaremos las especificaciones y responderemos con un plan de maquinado exacto.
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:info@vyroba.com.mx" class="cursor-pointer bg-[#162839] border border-[#162839] text-surface px-10 py-6 font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[0.8rem] md:text-sm shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_#1a1c1c] hover:translate-x-[4px] hover:translate-y-[4px] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_#1a1c1c] hover:bg-surface hover:text-[#162839] hover:border-surface active:translate-x-[8px] active:translate-y-[8px] active:shadow-none transition-all duration-150 inline-flex items-center justify-center">
                <span>Enviar Planos y Requerimientos</span>
            </a>
            <div class="mt-8 flex gap-6 text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-surface/60 uppercase">
                <span>+ INFO +52 55 3645 1199</span>
                <span>|</span>
                <span>INFO@VYROBA.COM.MX</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>